window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Dr. Phoenix Reid isn't who she seems.... </p> <p>Everyone knows a phoenix rises from the ashes. What they don't talk about are the people she drags with her into the fire. </p> <p>I thought one hot night with Max Hallowell was harmless. I never expected it would force me to face my past or bring back the man who swore he'd never let me go. Now, Max wants to help me - wants to save me. But if I let him, he'll be destroyed. I can already smell the flames. </p> <p>This audiobook is about a woman with a secret past, a man determined to protect her, and a dangerous passion that could cost them both everything. </p>"; 
